        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GumPop!</strong> is a 3D Puzzle Platformer inspired by Portal and Bubble Bobble where you have to solve challenging Puzzles by using various types of Bubbles and Bubble abilities. You are the exterminator Wilhelmina (Billie) “Bubble” Tuck who is tasked to clear out one of the biggest and most famous sweet factory's in the world from mutated, oversized and dangerous sweets who overran the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original version was created by the student project team Anonymous Animals at Mediadesign University (mdh) in Berlin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anonymous Animals: </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Design:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antonia &quot;Anton&quot; Dittmer, Leonhard Stettnisch, Samuel &quot;Sammy&quot; Gower</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emily Schütze, Gina-Marie Bognar, Lucas Wuerth, Zhenyu Wang</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Programming:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conor Huismann, Isabelle Diehl</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Producing:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samuel &quot;Sammy&quot; Gower</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Project Lecturers:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sylvius Lack, Heiko Ihde,  Henning Janssen, Dustin Paasch</p>",
